{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22980","headline":"荅元八郎中杨十二博士 · 白居易","name":"荅元八郎中杨十二博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身觉浮云无所着，心同止水有何情。\n但知潇洒疎朝市，不要崎岖隐姓名。\n尽日观鱼临涧坐，有时随鹿上山行。\n谁能抛得人间事，来共腾腾过此生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}